    "group": "Kabalite Warriors",
    "summary": "At the moment you choose this unit to shoot, you can pay one Pain token to Empower it, provided it is your Shooting Phase. The same option is available when choosing it for combat during the Fight Phase. While Empowered, its models can reroll a Wound result showing 1. If the target lies within an objective marker’s control range, the reroll is available for any Wound result instead.",
